{"unit_id":"Suibianlilili__dsh-always-on-top#card-zh","repo":"Suibianlilili/dsh-always-on-top","commit":"4de8beb645258fd5259b47d5ca7aab50ece9ef90","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-always-on-top 是面向 DSH Desktop 的 Windows 插件，会在桌面窗口标题栏添加一个图钉按钮。点击按钮即可切换主窗口的始终置顶状态，按钮颜色和提示文字会同步显示当前状态。插件通过 DSH host 路由调用 Windows PowerShell 修改窗口样式，并将用户选择保存下来，在下次启动后尝试恢复。它还提供状态查询和显式设置接口，处理连续点击与操作失败。适合希望让 DSH Desktop 主窗口保持在其他窗口上方的 Windows 用户；需要 DSH Desktop 和 PowerShell，不需要 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:183-228","lib/client.js:135-179"]}
{"unit_id":"Suibianlilili__dsh-always-on-top#card-en","repo":"Suibianlilili/dsh-always-on-top","commit":"4de8beb645258fd5259b47d5ca7aab50ece9ef90","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-always-on-top adds a pin button to the DSH Desktop title bar on Windows. Click to keep the main window above others; the button shows the current state. It saves the preference and attempts to restore it at launch. Requires DSH Desktop and PowerShell.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:183-228","lib/client.js:135-179"]}
